A mail list[1] has been created for the Certifiable Linux Integration
Platform (CLIP). CLIP is an open source project[2] that configures a
RHEL system and leverages SELinux features to provide a solid foundation
for building secure solutions that meet government security
requirements. 

Discussion of all aspects of the project are welcome on this mail list,
including questions about general usage, patches against existing
instances, questions about current development, and any other comments.

